counterfactuals.output:
1. A pharmacy formulation preparation crock component comprising:  

a lid plate configured to at least partially cover an opening of a formulation-receiving crock body;  

a fastening extension extending from the lid plate and configured to releasably couple the lid plate to a mating portion of the crock body;  

a lifting arm connected to, or formed integrally with, the lid plate and projecting outwardly therefrom to facilitate manual lifting, positioning, or removal of the lid plate relative to the crock body; and  

one or more outer thread regions disposed on an outer surface of the fastening extension, the one or more outer thread regions being configured to threadably engage corresponding inner thread regions of the crock body,  

wherein the lid plate, the fastening extension, the lifting arm, and the one or more outer thread regions are arranged to permit selective attachment and detachment of the component from the crock body during preparation of a pharmaceutical formulation.
